        <div class="jcBand">
            <div id="pnlJobDescription">
	
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">This position is located in the city of <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="text-decoration-line: underline; color: #0000ff;">San Marcos</span></span></strong>.</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Under the general supervision of the Staff Services Manager I, a Support Services Assistant – Interpreter performs the following duties:</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Duties involve a wide range of interpreting for Department of Rehabilitation (DOR) staff members. Activities include, but are not limited to: interpreting professional meetings, telephone calls, one-on-one meetings with departmental staff or the general public, case staffing, training sessions, departmental operations, inter-departmental meetings, conferences and public events as needed by the department. May retrieve voicemail messages, return calls and assist with other communication needs of the employee. </span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The SSA-I will on occasion interpret for other DOR staff members who have contact with consumers with whom interpreter services are needed. May work at various sites to meet client/employee needs, this position may require travel based on department needs.</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br /></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">When it is required, the SSA-I will interpret as a team with other SSA - Interpreters or contract interpreters to support the DOR Team Members.<br /><br />*Multiple vacancies may exist. </span></div><div><br /></div><p>You will find additional information about the job in the <strong><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=25195675&name=SSA-I-DutyStatement-SanMarcos.docx' target='_blank'>Duty Statement</a></strong>.</p>
                </p>
            
</div>

            <div id="pnlWorkingConditions">
	
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Working Conditions</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <p style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span>Permanent Intermittent employees are not allowed to work more than 1500 hours in a calendar year.&nbsp;The </span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">anticipated</span><span> time worked will be 30 hours per week.&nbsp;If selected, the employee will receive an hourly compensation based on the number of hours worked.<br /><br /><span style="border: 0px; background: #ffffff; color: #505050; text-decoration-color: initial;">The hourly range for the Support Services Assistant - Intrepreter is: $</span><span style="border: 0px; background: #ffffff; color: #505050; text-decoration-color: initial;">22.76 - $</span><span style="border: 0px; background: #ffffff; color: #505050; text-decoration-color: initial;">32.52.</span> </span></p>
                </p>
            
</div>
        </div>

        <div class="jcBand">

            
                <div class="col col-half">
                    <h3 class="postingHeader">Minimum Requirements</h3>

                    <span id="lblMinimumReqsInClassSpec">You will find the Minimum Requirements in the Class Specification.</span><ul><li><a href='https://hrnet.calhr.ca.gov/CalHRNet/SpecCrossReference.aspx?ClassID=9820' target='_blank'>SUPPORT SERVICES ASSISTANT (INTERPRETER)</a></li></ul>
                </div>
            

            <div class="col col-half" style="vertical-align: top;">
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Additional Documents</h3>

                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=452777'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li><li><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=25195675&name=SSA-I-DutyStatement-SanMarcos.docx'>Duty Statement</a></li></ul>

            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="jcBand">

            <div id="pnlPositionDetails" class="col col-half " style="vertical-align: top;">
	
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Position Details</h3>
